null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121061","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121061","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121061.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121061.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Contributes to resolving #43440\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAdds simple getter/setter unit tests to `Button`\r\n- Set/Get Text\r\n- Set/Get Text Direction\r\n- Set/Get Text Alignment\r\n- Set/Get Icon\r\n- Set/Get Icon Alignment\r\n\r\nAdds `Base Button` test file and unit tests\r\n- Tests `get_draw_mode()` behavior for each draw mode\r\n- Moves `is_hovered()` test from `Button` to `BaseButton`, where the behavior is defined\r\n- Tests `set_pressed_no_signal()` sets pressed and unpressed, and does not send a signal\r\n\r\n## Follow-up\r\n- Definitely more functionality that needs testing; didn't want a huge commit in my first PR \r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121061/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_ur